#!/bin/bash
# moekoe（docker 型）生命周期：容器的起停由应用中心管理，这里只报状态
COMPOSE="${TRIM_APPDEST}/docker/docker-compose.yaml"

container_name() {
    grep -m1 'container_name' "$COMPOSE" 2>/dev/null | awk -F: '{print $2}' | tr -d ' "'
}

case "$1" in
start|stop)
    # docker 应用由 appcenter 负责起停，无需处理
    exit 0
    ;;
status)
    name="$(container_name)"
    [ -n "$name" ] || exit 3
    docker inspect "$name" 2>/dev/null | grep -q '"Status": "running"' && exit 0 || exit 3
    ;;
*)
    exit 1
    ;;
esac
